<h1>Update on your class submission</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @instructor&.name.presence || @instructor&.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your submitted class <strong>"<%= @template.title %>"</strong> has been moved back
  to <em>pending review</em> by the studio owner. This may mean further edits are
  needed before it can go live.
</p>

<div class="order-card">
  <div class="order-row">
    <span class="lbl">Class</span>
    <span class="val"><%= @template.title %></span>
  </div>
  <% if @template.description.present? %>
  <div class="order-row">
    <span class="lbl">Description</span>
    <span class="val"><%= @template.description %></span>
  </div>
  <% end %>
</div>

<p>Please reach out to your studio owner for more details, then update and resubmit the class.</p>

<% content_for :footer do %>
  You received this because you submitted a class for approval on StudioFlow.
<% end %>
